eld together by additional layers of rot and decay. Its body, a macabre tapestry of putrid flesh and decomposing matter, seems on the verge of disintegration. Foul-smelling gases seep from its decaying form, creating a noxious cloud that precedes its arrival. Like a grotesque puppet, the Rotten Man-Maggot moves with a sickening gait, its movements accompanied by the squelching of decayed flesh. Its jagged, skeletal appendages lash out with surprising speed, fueled by an unholy strength drawn from the very rot that binds its form. It is a macabre testament to the twisted nature of the fallen realm, embodying the horrors that lurk within its darkest corners.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"4312576280fe2ac417ea99da9a9e785b\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Bloated_and_Rotten_Man-Maggot_Artwork-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:152px;\"><img alt=\"Official Creature Artwork\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Official \" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bloated_and_Rotten_Man_Maggot_Artwork_07cf21.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Bloated and Rotten Man-Maggot Artwork.jpg (480 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Official Creature Artwork</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\">Unknown.</div>\n<div style=\"cle